ٰ</tajweed>نَ لَكَفُو<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ م</tajweed>ُّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٌ <span class=end>١٥</span>","End":"١٥","PageNumber":490,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":424,"MaqraNumber":196,"HizbNumber":49,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":43,"SurahIndex":"043","VerseNumber":16,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمِ ٱتَّخَذَ مِمَّا يَخۡلُقُ بَنَاتٖ وَأَصۡفَىٰكُم بِٱلۡبَنِينَ","TajweedText":"أَمِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّخَذَ مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا يَخْلُقُ بَنَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>تٍ و</tajweed>َأَصْفَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ك<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْبَن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>١٦</span>","End":"١٦","PageNumber":490,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":425,"MaqraNumber":196,"HizbNumber":49,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":43,"SurahIndex":"043","VerseNumber":17,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِذَا بُشِّرَ أَحَدُهُم بِمَا ضَرَبَ لِلرَّحۡمَٰنِ مَثَلٗا ظَلَّ وَجۡهُهُۥ مُسۡوَدّٗا وَهُوَ كَظِيمٌ","TajweedText":"وَإِذَا بُشِّرَ أَحَدُه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِمَا ضَرَبَ لِلرَّحْمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نِ مَثَل<tajweed class=ikhafa>اً ظ</tajweed>َلَّ وَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>هُهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مُسْوَد<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ًّا و</tajweed>َهُوَ كَظ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>١٧</span>","End":"١٧","PageNumber":490,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":425,"MaqraNumber":196,"HizbNumber":49,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":43,"SurahIndex":"043","VerseNumber":18,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَوَمَن يُنَشَّؤُاْ فِي ٱلۡحِلۡيَةِ وَهُوَ فِي ٱلۡخِصَامِ غَيۡرُ مُبِينٖ","TajweedText":"أَوَم<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>ُنَشَّؤُ